WEBVTT

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.480
Ryoko, you've
escaped from Kagato.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.490
You...

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.330
Too late now. Why didn't you
escape earlier?

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.300
He was trying to save you.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.100
Tenchi was.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.700
A hand-to-hand fight
seems inevitable.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.160
It's the only way.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.700
What are you talking about?

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.250
It's more important
to look for Tenchi.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.120
You should have
known that...

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.100
It can't be...

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.620
It's not over yet.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.010
No.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.320
I'm going
to kill Kagato...

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.400
At all costs.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.660
Let's go!

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:04.010
Episode #6
WE NEED TENCHI!

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:09.140
Tenchi! Tenchi!
Don't die!

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:30.820
From heaven to the ocean...
Ocean to the earth...

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.880
And earth back to heaven...

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:38.180
Show me the path engraved
by the light.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.320
What do we do?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.760
All the passages
lead to him.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.050
Got it.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:54.730
Please wait!

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.540
Please don't come near me!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.910
There must be
an entrance somewhere.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.100
Does that mean
we can go in?

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:37.210
We are being invited, so let's go.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:46.470
Ryoko, wait for me.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.100
Oh, no.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.600
Where has she gone?

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:05.200
Wait! Wait!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:08.560
Oh, no.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:13.370
Wait! Please wait!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:56.410
Welcome to my Great
Cathedral, ladies.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.250
How dare you!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:00.960
Scumbag!

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.130
That was a powerful shot,
Princess Ayeka...

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:11.970
But this chapel's force field
reflects all energy that attacks it.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.360
Here is a lesson for you.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.650
His shadow?

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:28.070
700 years seem to
have been too long for you.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:31.130
If you can't tell reality
from imagination...

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.410
You still have
some way to go.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:35.750
Don't... my arm.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.660
Rest for a while.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.640
Let me take a look...

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:00.100
at the Tsunami unit's
secret message, Princess Ayeka.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.980
Where are Ayeka
and the others?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.280
Could they be with Kagato?

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:13.280
Am I left to myself?

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.730
All right, if I'm alone...

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.780
I will go after Kagato...

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:21.410
and make good the unfulfilled
wishes of my friends.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:22.250
What!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:31.170
Keep away!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.680
You have the right
to remain silent.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:38.400
Whatever you say may be used
against you in a court of law.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:41.310
You have the right
to request an attorney.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.840
If you have no money...

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.740
a public defender will
be assigned...

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.230
and then...

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.590
That's all.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:03.500
If you run away, there's going
to be an extra punishment.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.670
It isn't working.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.500
I need a more
powerful rifle.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:14.550
Where did I put it?

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:25.850
No!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.320
Don't worry. It's dead...

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.640
And thank you
for helping me out.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.280
How did you get lost
and end up here?

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.340
You are...

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:44.190
Here's another person for you.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:47.080
This poor little helpless one.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.380
Don't you think so, Mihoshi?

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.380
-Excuse me.
-Let's see.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.550
Excuse me.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.420
Nothing's broken.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.660
Excuse me.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:59.430
That jerk tried to destroy
my important work.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.560
He won't get away with it.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.770
Excuse me. Who are you?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:09.020
Your dress looks like the uniform
of the old Science Academy.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.940
Are you out of your mind?

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.860
Reduced muscle power will affect
your combat capability.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:19.410
That may well affect your...
visual-psychological warfare.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.680
Am I out of my mind?

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.660
It's none of your business.

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:28.710
And what do you mean by
visual-psychological warfare?

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.880
I mean erotic warfare.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:32.990
You little brat.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.780
Do you know what
you're talking about?

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:38.510
I've been wearing the same
size for 700 years.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:42.350
That's no way for you
to speak to your Mother.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.530
Not only for you.

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:50.020
I'm also the creator of
Ryo-Ohki and Soja as well.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.470
In your case, though,
I used my eggs...

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:55.030
so I'm more like
your Mother.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.280
Oh, maybe you're that
little schoolgirl...

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.280
who was abducted by Kagato.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.820
Schoolgirl?

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.200
No. My name is Washu...

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.670
and I'm the greatest
scientist in the universe.

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:09.170
Although I'm sure I look
fresh like a schoolgirl.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.740
Don't you agree, Ryoko?

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.730
Stop joking!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:16.510
Ever since I was born
2,000 years ago...

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.220
Was I born?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.600
Anyway, where are we?

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:23.960
This is the reversed world.

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:24.780
Reversed?

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:27.010
This ship
has a double structure--

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:29.010
A top and bottom
and a one-way thoroughfare.

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:32.560
I don't care!
How do we get to Kagato?

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.480
To get even for Tenchi?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.990
Why do you know
about Tenchi?

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.780
Just as you are connected
to Ryo-Ohki...

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:43.950
I am connected to you.

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.990
That's why I know.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:48.120
I know everything.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:51.620
Everything about
your feelings for Tenchi.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.600
"I like you. I love you."

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.960
"I've never felt like this before.
I'd go anywhere with you."

00:10:57.150 --> 00:11:00.920
Your future with Tenchi
was going to...

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.760
She knows that much?

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.850
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:08.680
If you want to go,
I won't stop you.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.940
It should be
no problem for you.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.650
Please stop, Ryoko.

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:15.520
You are fighting
the wrong person.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:20.780
I'm sorry
for the trouble, Ryoko.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.740
I have one request for you
before you go, Ryoko.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:29.500
Please call me Mama.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:33.790
Ryoko!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.200
Let's go right away.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.400
No, we can't.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.080
Once we are shut in here...

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.480
We can't get out unless
we destroy Kagato.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:42.590
Yes, but...

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:46.300
I have just brought Ryoko's
astral body here.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.140
Her physical body has
been outside.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.190
Where are we again?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:02.010
Ayeka.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:03.860
Brother.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.240
Ayeka.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.650
Tell me...

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:10.830
Tell you? What?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.290
About the greatest force
in the universe.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.330
You can tap into it
with the master key,

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.850
It's an ancestor of the royal
family's tree,

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.840
the King of the universe who
rules the entire earth, Tsunami.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:22.330
Tsunami?

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:25.890
How can only your clan
profit by it?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.850
No, you are not my brother.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.600
Leave me alone!

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.770
Is it the blood
of your clan?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:35.480
Let me go!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.540
What is needed?

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:42.190
No! Help me, Tenchi!

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:47.050
That damned Tsunami!

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:51.330
Are you protecting
the clan's royal blood?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.950
What are you going
to do about it?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:57.250
You, stranger. Have you
opened our birdcage?

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:00.960
I have a little task for you.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.670
O.K. with me.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.340
What has happened to me?

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.230
You're all right.

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:17.310
Who are you,
and where are we?

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:20.280
I am Tsunami,
the ship of Jurai.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.150
We are inside of me.

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.290
Inside of you?

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.280
But you are a human being.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:29.230
I see... You are
the owner of this ship.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.830
No. The owner is Sasami.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.120
Sasami?

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.000
Yes...

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:39.080
And I am the mind
of this ship.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.000
Then it's like the human
version of Ryo-Ohki.

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.340
Oh, no! Ryo-ohki...!

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.550
Where are Ayeka
and the others?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.180
70 light-seconds from here...

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.510
there is a reaction
of Ryu-Oh's key.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.640
Are they all right?

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:56.480
That reaction can
be felt inside here.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.310
Inside?

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.560
There's a hand-to-hand
fight going on.

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:04.400
A fight inside?

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.360
Please take me there.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.360
I cannot leave this place.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:13.330
You must go alone.

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.830
Can you go alone?

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.080
I don't mind it.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.540
All right. Untill then...

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.880
Can we really not get out of here?

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.010
That's just what
I've been explaining to you.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.680
It's like this here.
And like that over there.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.800
And the last line is this.

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:39.490
That's why we can never
get out of this place.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:40.480
Understand?

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:43.940
I don't understand a word.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:50.530
So we can never
get out of this place?

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.740
I've told you many times.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.830
Still, this is
your creation.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.000
That's why it's so perfect.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:10.790
What can I say?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.760
There are two things
we can do.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.730
Oh?

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:17.850
Ryoko.

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:20.540
What can we do?

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.940
Take this.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:26.020
Hooray! Hooray! Ryoko!

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.760
Does it work?

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.740
All right, Ryoko!

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.450
I hope so.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.910
That's a super-compressed
tektite column.

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.460
It must have been damaged.

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:55.890
Sorry, Princess.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:08.110
I could squeeze you
to death.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.440
That's quite a show.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:11.610
What?

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.260
What do you have in mind?

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.030
Why doesn't that fool
get serious?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.720
No, you're mistaken.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:19.780
If she were serious...

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.280
This would be over by now.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:22.410
Excuse me.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.400
Even though she penetrated
Kagato's force-field,...

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.000
there is no way
for her to win.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.170
Ryoko!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.050
I see, that was why...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.640
What do you mean?

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.430
If she had been serious...

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:46.950
The discharge of the extra energy
would have burned up Ayeka.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.200
What can we do then?

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.190
Give me your cube.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.190
Here, Princess Ayeka.

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:09.370
Ayeka.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:10.890
We can't get over there...

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:12.500
But they can come here.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:15.880
You are making it easier
for Ryoko to fight, huh?

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:19.760
Even my power
can't reach here.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.850
If that's so, go away now.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:25.060
I will let you go
for old times' sake.

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:26.600
Let me go?

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.320
You have no more hostages.

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.270
Hostages?

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:34.740
I'm no longer your assistant... Professor.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.550
Do you assume that I
haven't learned anything...

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:39.200
in the past 5,000 years?

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:41.330
What was that?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:45.500
I have unleashed all the
force of the Soja's gems.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.160
Unfortunately...

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:49.920
I couldn't develop a more
compact version... like Ryoko.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.880
But, in one session...

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.130
I can pull up far more
power than Ryoko can.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.590
My power is being drained!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.680
I'm going to show you
a little experiment...

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.800
just like the old days.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:07.810
You can't...

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.020
Princess Ayeka, if I can't
have your cooperation...

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:15.250
I can always go to
your brother and sister.

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:17.820
Stop!

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:24.200
Sasami! Yosho!

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.900
There it is.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:39.510
It's amazing! How can
it take so much energy.

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:44.100
With only those wings...?

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.220
What is this?

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.400
What in the world
is happening?

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.910
The wings of the Light-Hawk!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:07.490
The most powerful ship
of Jurai, Tsunami.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.250
That one...

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:12.040
The shield is not working!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:16.210
There's still more to come
from the force of the gems!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.800
That is the ship
of the beginning.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.170
Your role is finished.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.140
When your consciousness
goes to sleep...

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.140
all the power of your gems
will belong to Soja.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.010
Too bad that you
won't be able to see...

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.520
how I rule the universe.

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.020
I'm sorry, Tenchi.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:39.760
What is this?

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:41.230
Oh, no.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:45.460
Tenchi.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.660
I still have legs.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.950
So you're still alive, huh?

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.250
Tenchi, please don't!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.370
Don't worry.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.630
So where do we go
from here, young man?

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.010
What?

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.760
I can't pull it out.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.150
I'm worried...

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.480
Tenchi, leave that to us.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.520
Here we go!

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:16.810
Those things are
too relaxed to attack!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.400
Look after Ryoko!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.280
All right.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:29.160
What?

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:33.910
Just when I needed it most...

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:36.160
If you can't use your weapon,
it becomes meaningless.

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.460
The master key
is after all...

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:44.220
only for extracting power
from the ship.

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:47.010
Without the ship's power,
it's useless.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:56.700
Tenchi!

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:58.730
I can't move.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.900
What are you all doing?
Help Tenchi out!

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:02.910
No, I can't.

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:05.070
My feet are caught
by powerful forces...

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.110
I have to release them.

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:10.950
What's wrong? Isn't your
sword helping you?

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:15.660
You would be alive today if
you had abandoned those girls.

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:19.460
I'd rather die than forsake
any one of them!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:25.880
Fine. My gemstone lineup
is complete.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.810
This force is wonderful.

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:39.810
I'm ready for you.
Come to me now, Tsunami!

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:45.820
Is this the end for us?

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:49.410
Do something about it.
You created this ship.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:51.000
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:53.770
There must be
an alternative.

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:56.960
There is only one more
thing we can do.

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:58.250
What is it?

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:00.960
Pray to the gods.

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.590
I'm scared, Tsunami!

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:12.720
All those forces
will belong to me.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:16.520
The strongest
in the universe.

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:17.730
Tenchi.

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:24.440
Sasami, I think it's impossible
to save your sister.

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:26.740
I can't use my sword.

00:22:27.470 --> 00:22:29.570
Trust your own power.

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:36.200
Please be careful. That
ship is extremely dangerous.

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:39.710
Don't worry. I think
I can manage with this.

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:41.080
No.

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:45.040
The sword is just a tool
for drawing power.

00:22:47.660 --> 00:22:50.680
More importantly,
trust your own power.

00:22:52.900 --> 00:22:54.730
My power?

00:22:55.400 --> 00:22:56.430
Mine?

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:57.600
Yes.

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:07.950
Oh... do you still have
some spirit left in you?

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:10.900
I guess I was really
depending on this sword.

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:16.370
I was going to dispose
of you later... but never mind.

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:21.080
Are you quite sure?

00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:23.710
Tenchi, run away! Tenchi!

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:28.340
Please, stop. Please.

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:31.410
You have all you wanted.

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:34.640
Please spare Tenchi.

00:23:34.770 --> 00:23:37.710
Is this young man
that important to you?

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:40.140
Don't worry.

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:42.980
I will make sure that you
and Princess Ayeka...

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:47.810
will be following him soon,
so he won't be lonesome.

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:49.070
Don't.

00:23:58.260 --> 00:24:00.580
Next is your turn.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:04.420
All the force from the ship
should have been shut off by now!

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:10.420
You little bastard!

00:24:16.210 --> 00:24:18.100
Is that what you
have created?

00:24:22.790 --> 00:24:24.560
Material metamorphosis!

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:26.060
Incredible!

00:24:26.060 --> 00:24:27.560
The wings of the Light-Hawk!

00:24:39.200 --> 00:24:40.160
I've got you!

00:24:50.880 --> 00:24:54.920
Tenchi-- the same name
as the master key, huh?

00:24:54.920 --> 00:24:55.970
Well done, Tsunami.

00:24:56.490 --> 00:24:58.390
Tenchi can't be copied.

00:24:58.960 --> 00:25:00.150
Splendid plan.

00:25:02.530 --> 00:25:04.400
You've won, boy.

00:25:07.500 --> 00:25:10.440
A boy who can create
the wings of the Light-Hawk.

00:25:11.320 --> 00:25:13.610
I'm going to make him mine!

00:25:24.250 --> 00:25:25.460
Tenchi!

00:25:26.950 --> 00:25:28.420
Tenchi!

00:25:29.960 --> 00:25:31.280
Tenchi!

00:25:35.060 --> 00:25:38.720
Sorry. I'm the first
to see him.

00:25:38.900 --> 00:25:40.090
Tenchi!

00:25:43.230 --> 00:25:44.970
You beast.

00:25:45.500 --> 00:25:48.390
How do you do?
My name is Washu.

00:25:48.810 --> 00:25:51.470
Thank you for saving me
from Kagato.

00:25:51.470 --> 00:25:52.600
Uh... sure.

00:25:52.600 --> 00:25:54.230
I like you.

00:25:54.230 --> 00:25:56.280
Would you like to become
my guinea pig?

00:25:56.480 --> 00:25:57.810
Hey, you.

00:25:57.810 --> 00:25:58.910
What, Ryoko?

00:25:59.280 --> 00:26:02.870
Tenchi!

00:26:06.620 --> 00:26:08.120
Shut up!

00:26:14.660 --> 00:26:17.920
Soja was cut in half
with Kagato.

00:26:18.170 --> 00:26:21.030
Don't just stand
there, looking impressed!

00:26:31.180 --> 00:26:32.480
Thank you.

00:26:32.620 --> 00:26:33.270
Very much.

00:26:40.590 --> 00:26:41.960
What's happened?

00:26:42.460 --> 00:26:43.370
I wonder.

00:26:47.360 --> 00:26:50.210
Please, both of you,
stop that.

00:26:50.210 --> 00:26:51.290
Let them continue.

00:26:51.290 --> 00:26:52.230
I can't.

00:26:52.230 --> 00:26:54.210
Breakfast's ready.

00:26:54.500 --> 00:26:57.040
It's going to be
another fine day today.

00:26:57.040 --> 00:27:00.680
And it's a nice
and peaceful breakfast.
